# Supply-chain hardening (Shai-Hulud wave, 2026-08-04): never execute package
# install scripts — every Shai-Hulud wave entered via a preinstall hook.
# Native deps here (esbuild, fsevents) ship prebuilt platform binaries via
# optionalDependencies and work without scripts. If a binary is ever missing
# after `npm ci`, run: npm rebuild <package> --foreground-scripts
# Field note: docs/field-notes/2026-08-04-shai-hulud-keyv-supply-chain-audit.md
ignore-scripts=true
